title: Remove deprecated reclaim extension
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: Removes the original `StorageWeightReclaim` extension which was deprecated
    for 1.5 years or so. It has been replaced by the Corresponding pallet which is
    more accurate. No runtime in this repo or fellowship still use the inaccurate
    one. Anyone else should also migrate if they were still using it.
crates:
- name: cumulus-primitives-storage-weight-reclaim
  bump: major
- name: cumulus-pallet-weight-reclaim
  bump: major
